      "note": "The skill has no schnell section; the graph follows its FLUX.1 pattern: UNETLoader with weight_dtype default, DualCLIPLoader type flux with t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors and clip_l.safetensors, VAELoader ae.safetensors, CFG 1.0, ConditioningZeroOut as negative, EmptyLatentImage, 1024x1024, multiples of 8. The sampler values are its 4-step distilled settings (euler, simple). The skill's FluxGuidance or CLIPTextEncodeFlux guidance is left out because schnell has no guidance embedding (guidance_embed False for FluxSchnell in comfy/supported_models.py). The skill says Z-Image's VAE differs from this one although both are named ae.safetensors; which of the two the installed ae.safetensors is has not been checked."
